{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ab9c67c3b5daf6588426b3e32480b33efb22bf24f2262820b5dab1d415faa05", "ja": "（海美、伊織、雪歩が前座を務める予定のライブが\n目前に迫っている。海美の様子はどうかな……？）", "zh": "（海美、伊织和雪步预定担任开场表演的演唱会就要开始了。海美现在怎么样了呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "4067d246ae8708454eb6231849c328f872abebede9f35bbe4b368b33a93ca0dc", "ja": "神秘的で壮大で……カリスマっぽく……？\nうう～ん……むむむ……。", "zh": "神秘、宏大……还要有魅力感……？\n唔～……嗯嗯嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6de47ba12c0ff7f5f7483ddfbd4cf7e0c0d8bc3180d79cdbf2f8ccce26aff60f", "ja": "どうしたんだ、海美。\n難しい顔で……。", "zh": "怎么了，海美？\n怎么一脸苦恼的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c1efbc7736f56d3a5967f86582ac3d18b7535bbc3edfcf6db72118b0134382e5", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}、いいところに！\n今度のステージ、ちょっと自信ないかも……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你来得正好！\n下次的舞台，我可能有点没自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5fd8f31aaa71d4c0ee913b2fe6e076f83f41c34b4f704b3967fbc1d9fa50efdb", "ja": "えっ！？　何があったんだ？", "zh": "咦！？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "fc7761d7febfa537901c8f0c8fc1e7594d8d6c9a2d1b11d10a91e23d40544ac9", "ja": "練習してたら「落ち着きがなくて、全っ然、神秘的に\n見えない！」って、いおりんに怒られちゃった……。", "zh": "练习的时候，被伊织说“你太坐不住了，根本一点都看不出神秘感！”还被她骂了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "9d05639a950c6c574498a8bc555d567e68288d7b190897be96eca7d67367ade5", "ja": "私も意識はしてるんだよ？　静かな感じで\n動いてるつもりなんだけど、うまくいかなくて……。", "zh": "我也有在注意哦？我本来是想用安静的感觉来行动的，可就是做不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4858c3924d239930a1cfd6d21902a6780ff9b4a456a3edd03fbea341680b6d87", "ja": "なるほど。それで自信が……。", "zh": "原来如此。所以你才会没有自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "cc413a70b68ee71a0290a306c403debadb8cb988be1e63e671ada76a08428612", "ja": "うん……。{$P$}、どうしたらいい？\n……あ、パワーストーンとかつけてみる？", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}，该怎么办才好？\n……啊，要不要试着戴个能量石之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5f8a28169ba2e5466c448bea2d1161395358c65862b12b1fed002d084a3971ba", "ja": "それは、違うんじゃないかな……。伊織の指摘は、\n動きだったり、雰囲気についてだと思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得那不太对吧……伊织指出的，应该是动作或者氛围之类的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "74be07d0df4289a50449cce63e5b9ed791c0dfb8d3a8e7a0a713ece4a77f4794", "ja": "やっぱそうだよね～……でも意識すればするほど\n体が勝手に動いちゃうんだもん～！", "zh": "果然是这样啊～……可是越是在意，\n身体就越会不由自主地动起来嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1011_p", "source_sha256": "05a33dc2a2c5a652745149882529a325021cd8d9f68c54971cfab769c3384fa2", "ja": "……なかなか深刻だな。それなら、\n海美の得意なバレエで考えてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "……还真是挺严重的。既然这样，要不要试着从海美擅长的芭蕾入手？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7357d1c947cfa959e1438a54898b5f703a24ea3d05a98b187537c0efef0fcf93", "ja": "バレエにも、落ち着いた曲とか、\n神秘的な演目とかあったりするんじゃないか？", "zh": "芭蕾舞里，也有舒缓的曲子、神秘的剧目之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "4f7d15cedd1032fb1ae7d6110a0c774a7eb72c7e912bff273712dbec5d874892", "ja": "うーん、『ジゼル』かな～？　お姉ちゃんが踊ったのを\n見たことがあるけど、すっごく綺麗だったんだ♪", "zh": "嗯……《吉赛尔》吧～？我看过姐姐跳的这部舞，真的特别美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "1fe53b1d12b88bf8ebfec5cb3f0b1b8612898501e9752095b10ec33d27e5f1f4", "ja": "精霊が出てくるお話なんだけど、動きがふわっとしてて\n雰囲気もあって……あ、そっか！", "zh": "虽然是精灵出现的故事，但动作轻飘飘的，很有氛围……啊，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "3fafd3e2bf5f262df7d6223a978c4719f70f6e49889b9c11bca2d1d575d6217b", "ja": "私、なんか分かったかも。{$P$}、\nちょっと、いおりんのところ行ってくるね！", "zh": "我好像明白了什么。{$P$}，\n我去伊织那边一下，先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1016_p", "source_sha256": "afad5fe889007723ec539683509ac3314c088a1a300ffeefdebbc74b766d8345", "ja": "ああ、行ってらっしゃい。\n転ばないように、気を付けてな！", "zh": "啊，去吧。\n小心点，别摔着了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0553_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7c9a69b566c8dabeca00cc14234ef99a6868b73e62f7e0f6a77ac923196a584", "ja": "うんっ！　それじゃ、レッスンルームへ、\nうみみーん、ダーッシュ☆", "zh": "嗯！那就冲向练习室，海美——冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
